# Compiled content. `npm run build` regenerates it from the YAML on every run, and the
# YAML is the only source of truth (ADR-0004).
/public/content/

# `npm run export-pgn` output is generated for a round trip through a board GUI and is
# never committed, for the same reason. The PGN fixtures under tools/ are test *inputs*.
*.pgn
!tools/content/fixtures/pgn/*.pgn
